<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept base="Anywhere" id="t00558">
	<title>Driver Attention Warning settings</title>
	<prolog>
		<metadata>
			<keywords>
				<indexterm>driver attention warning (DAW)
					<indexterm>settings</indexterm>
				</indexterm>
			</keywords>
		</metadata>
	</prolog>
	<conbody>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e03586">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig id="e03587">
								<image href="images/N_SP3i25_C00_087_IR.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2">
							<ol outputclass="callout" id="e03588">
								<li>
									<p><uicontrol>Driver Assistance</uicontrol></p>
								</li>
								<li>
									<p><uicontrol>DAW (Driver Attention Warning)</uicontrol></p>
								</li>
								<li>
									<p><uicontrol>Leading Vehicle Departure Alert</uicontrol></p>
								</li>
								<li>
									<p><uicontrol>Inattentive Driving Warning</uicontrol></p>
								</li>
							</ol>
						</entry>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<p>While the vehicle is <term translate="no">ON</term>, tap <menucascade><uicontrol>Setup</uicontrol><uicontrol>Vehicle</uicontrol><uicontrol>Driver Assistance</uicontrol><uicontrol>Driver Attention Warning</uicontrol></menucascade> on the infotainment system screen.</p>
		<ul id="e03589">
			<li>
				<p><uicontrol>Leading Vehicle Departure Alert</uicontrol>: Driver Attention Warning will inform the driver when a detected vehicle in front departs from a stop.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p><uicontrol>Inattentive Driving Warning</uicontrol>: Inattentive Driving Warning of Driver Attention Warning can be turned on or off. (except Europe)</p>
			</li>
		</ul>
		<note type="warning" id="e03590">
			<ul id="e03591">
				<li>
					<p>If you deselect to turn off the Inattentive Driving Warning, DAW cannot assist you. The driver should always be aware of the surroundings and drive safely.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>The Inattentive Driving Warning is always activated when the vehicle is restarted. (only in Austraillia and New Zealand)</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>In Europe, the Inattentive Driving Warning is always on, and the warning setting menu is not displayed.</p>
				</li>
			</ul>
		</note>
	</conbody>
	<related-links>
		<linkpool>
			<link format="dita" href="t00557.dita#t00557" role="parent" scope="local" type="concept">
